  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "政府ê雙語國家政策對本土語言ê衝擊hām因應之道"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><b>主講／江文瑜&nbsp; &nbsp;</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><b>記錄／戴如意</b></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">本文是2021/8/11 ê講座摘要記錄，主講者江文瑜是台灣大學語言學研究所教授。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">行政院國家發展委員會tī 2018年提出「2030雙語國家政策發展藍圖」，雙語所指--ê是「英語」kap「台灣華語」，目標beh提升國民ê國際競爭力，hōo台灣tī 2030年ê時tsūn，tsiânn做一个雙語國家。其中有一條推動理念：「兼顧雙語政策hām母語文化發展」，是tsit份資料內底，唯一hām母語有關係ê政策。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tsit-má定義ê母語，包括：台灣話、客語、原住民語、馬祖ê閩東語hām手語。目前，學生tī國小到高中階段，一禮拜kan-ta ài上一節母語課，而且tī國三、高二、高三koh m̄是必修，用tsiah-nī少ê時數beh kā母語學好，根本是無可能ê代誌。江文瑜教授煩惱，若變成雙語國家，只是愈打壓母語ê生存環境。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">若看亞洲kā英語做國家語言ê國家，無論是新加坡、香港、馬來西亞，lóng有hōo英國殖民過百外冬ê歷史；lán隔壁ê菲律賓，mā hōo美國統治過49年。日本殖民台灣50冬，tī尾期，ē-sái理解日語ê台灣人，差不多占四成；hōo認證做「國語家庭」ê戶數，就koh愈少，kan-ta有1.3%。Tsit幾个例lóng顯示：beh tsiânn做一个雙語國家，m̄是tsiah-nī簡單ê代誌。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">江教授提出兩个訴求：頭一个是，kā雙語國家政策改做「2030英語環境友善政策」。英語tuì lán來講iáu是外國語 ，beh kā英語學hōo好，無定著台灣ài變雙語國家，重要--ê是，提供一个對英語友善ê環境，發展藍圖ê目標mā仝款做ē到；第二，雙語國家ê目標hām文化部「國家語言發展法」sio衝突，國發會kap文化部應該同齊討論對策。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tsit幾年政府thui-sak轉型正義，主要是tī lán目睭看ē著ê歷史事件kap人物，江教授提醒，語言ê轉型正義mā仝款重要。對經歷『我不說方言』世代ê人來講，母語hông剝削帶來真濟自卑kap痛苦，tse是失語者ê集體創傷，需要lán tsit-má起造多語ê環境來彌補。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">母語ê復振有幾个方面thang拍拚，頭起先是媒體，已經有ê公視台語台，ài koh提kuân預算，鼓勵製作koh-khah濟本土語言ê作品，投資國際級ê電影電視；mā ài提供語言友善ê環境，親像公家機關增加口語翻譯、補助老師用本土語言教課；koh有建置資料庫，kā語言資料電子化。逐家做伙拍拚，hōo本土語言koh-khah發展，kā lán ê母語揣倒tńg--來。</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjzrD-iNJeSAlU01xUeS_DpIZ1JF_CqYkc3ZMMIk3Uap7JeCV_VhQ3J9bpMPlnR2gRU0uRTmEvDFrPprgW3LAXqR7d4zWVXyvtkhBJxPM2YCPKF_CfLIUVMGBvsuYZ7ondcWcAAwy5dkrI3/s1424/330%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjzrD-iNJeSAlU01xUeS_DpIZ1JF_CqYkc3ZMMIk3Uap7JeCV_VhQ3J9bpMPlnR2gRU0uRTmEvDFrPprgW3LAXqR7d4zWVXyvtkhBJxPM2YCPKF_CfLIUVMGBvsuYZ7ondcWcAAwy5dkrI3/w450-h640/330%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3Kn1gFi9BkDLFHA4Oa3UzaV-7UfI_AmTQcH1zKJTkBDM1JwHolzk-3SCAd5HUKzXn9T1uqX6UX806v_yL8yAGuLFZjAYEsXLTkj2hY9t8lL2aqC7A60uWMtG3529qpahfJyRt1JFNKzsK/s2048/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1330%25E6%259C%259F_%25E9%25BB%2591%25E7%2599%25BD%25E5%2585%25A7%25E9%25A0%25810607.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1446\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3Kn1gFi9BkDLFHA4Oa3UzaV-7UfI_AmTQcH1zKJTkBDM1JwHolzk-3SCAd5HUKzXn9T1uqX6UX806v_yL8yAGuLFZjAYEsXLTkj2hY9t8lL2aqC7A60uWMtG3529qpahfJyRt1JFNKzsK/w640-h452/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1330%25E6%259C%259F_%25E9%25BB%2591%25E7%2599%25BD%25E5%2585%25A7%25E9%25A0%25810607.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>線頂看影片</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>台語sa攏有 - YouTube 頻道</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/exDAex\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/exDAex</a></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"background-color: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666;\"><b>#台語sa攏有講座</b></span></span><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666;\"><b>專欄，</b></span><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案</b></span><b style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif;\">。</b></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"><span><b>台文通訊BONG報330期，2021年9月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\">--------------------------------------------</div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\" /></div></div></div>"
